WEBVTT

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:17.450
<i>188, 187, 186...</i>

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:20.870
<i>The Imperial Ordinance System</i>
<i>will soon shut down.</i>

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:22.330
<i>Please evacuate.</i>

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:24.000
<i>182...</i>

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:25.120
Mom!

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:28.580
<i>180, 179...</i>

00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:39.120
No! No!

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:41.120
I don't want you to die!

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:43.290
I came to see you!

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:45.330
Not to kill you!

00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:48.120
I would never think of doing that.

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:50.410
Don't go!

00:00:50.870 --> 00:00:52.330
Don't leave me!

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:54.160
Mom!

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:56.200
Mom!

00:00:58.540 --> 00:00:59.950
Mom!

00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:31.830
A lie, eh?

00:02:33.370 --> 00:02:35.080
Was my whole life...

00:02:35.580 --> 00:02:38.290
spent for justification and ego?

00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:42.700
<i>Father...</i>

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:45.000
Will mankind...

00:02:46.410 --> 00:02:47.370
someday...

00:02:48.290 --> 00:02:49.370
be able to...

00:02:50.950 --> 00:02:53.580
take back the human world?

00:02:55.370 --> 00:02:56.200
Father...

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:05.200
The human world...

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:10.160
A world where people do not fear those
they cannot exchange words with,

00:03:10.660 --> 00:03:13.700
and where everyone can live
without feeding on each other.

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:15.910
If you call that the world of humans...

00:03:16.620 --> 00:03:20.410
<i>people have yet to know</i>
<i>what the true world of humans is.</i>

00:03:23.370 --> 00:03:25.700
<i>Negotiations are over, Bazaar Overseer.</i>

00:03:25.950 --> 00:03:27.950
<i>Hand over the control tower at once.</i>

00:03:28.700 --> 00:03:31.620
Or else, prepare for annihilation.

00:03:32.950 --> 00:03:33.830
Then...

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:36.950
our fate is one with this control tower.

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:47.700
We will now begin eliminating
the hostages one at a time.

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:50.250
Will you still continue to resist?

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:52.450
How foul!

00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:00.120
Damn it!

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:06.330
Fire! Sniper at 11 o'clock!

00:04:18.580 --> 00:04:19.410
How ruthless.

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:21.410
We'll take this and...

00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:24.040
Let me. This is my baby.

00:04:24.370 --> 00:04:26.830
I'm its dad,
so let me show off at the end.

00:04:36.950 --> 00:04:37.870
What's the matter?

00:04:37.950 --> 00:04:40.370
The system's down! The radio's out, too!

00:04:42.120 --> 00:04:44.370
What are you waiting for?!
Kill the hostages!

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:51.870
Get down!

00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:01.450
Remaining troops? Finish them!

00:05:26.330 --> 00:05:28.660
Why, aren't we both very lucky?

00:05:41.620 --> 00:05:44.750
You've underestimated this place
as a rats' nest, Salif Bakar.

00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:46.660
Petrov?

00:05:47.330 --> 00:05:48.830
State your defeat.

00:05:49.500 --> 00:05:52.620
That is your last job
as a commanding officer.

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:59.870
You think you've won?
You Allied Forces' dog!

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:05.160
None of you could ever understand
the noble mind of His Excellency!

00:06:05.950 --> 00:06:09.450
His Excellency will definitely create
a world without the fear of bugs!

00:06:09.830 --> 00:06:11.250
His Excellency's justice...

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:13.200
shall enlighten the world after!

00:06:14.620 --> 00:06:18.660
For the glory of His Excellency,
Lieutenant General Adham, and mankind!

00:06:30.620 --> 00:06:32.870
I lament over the queen's death.

00:06:33.500 --> 00:06:35.120
Even after killing my son twice.

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:40.830
This stubborn pride
did not reach its goal.

00:06:42.660 --> 00:06:44.370
My fellow men of 07,

00:06:45.160 --> 00:06:48.330
I praise you all
for your servitude these past ten years.

00:06:49.910 --> 00:06:51.700
I shall reward you for your work

00:06:52.080 --> 00:06:53.750
with my flesh and bones.

00:06:55.120 --> 00:06:57.250
Please forgive this powerless father.

00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:00.950
<i>Fifty-one...</i>

00:07:21.950 --> 00:07:22.910
Mom!

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:25.410
Mom!

00:07:27.080 --> 00:07:29.540
<i>I never thought I needed it.</i>

00:07:31.120 --> 00:07:34.410
<i>Even though I knew it was</i>
<i>for my own ego that I clung...</i>

00:07:35.450 --> 00:07:37.330
<i>I never expected a day to come...</i>

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:39.450
<i>when I would fully understand...</i>

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:41.910
<i>Franz.</i>

00:07:43.620 --> 00:07:46.160
<i>What you desired from Emeth Chilio</i>

00:07:46.870 --> 00:07:48.830
<i>and what I desired from you...</i>

00:07:49.750 --> 00:07:51.250
<i>were unobtainable.</i>

00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:54.700
<i>But...</i>

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:57.000
<i>I was able to find it.</i>

00:08:00.620 --> 00:08:01.700
<i>Ilie.</i>

00:08:15.700 --> 00:08:16.620
<i>I love you.</i>

00:08:21.540 --> 00:08:23.620
<i>Let the truth I discovered...</i>

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:26.160
<i>be with you.</i>

00:08:27.410 --> 00:08:28.250
Mom...

00:08:28.830 --> 00:08:31.290
<i>Five, four, three,</i>

00:08:31.870 --> 00:08:33.410
<i>two, one.</i>

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:42.370
Mom!

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:47.660
Tania!

00:08:56.870 --> 00:09:00.500
<i>Imperial Ordinance System,</i>
<i>physical disconnection has been completed.</i>

00:09:01.830 --> 00:09:05.700
<i>Decompressing chamber.</i>
<i>Water will be disposed.</i>

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:25.410
I'll listen if you got any last words.

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:28.120
I'm the type to keep promises
with dead men.

00:09:28.910 --> 00:09:30.160
I'm no man.

00:09:30.660 --> 00:09:31.910
So you like to say.

00:09:34.580 --> 00:09:37.580
There was once a guy who couldn't
follow through to become anything.

00:09:38.750 --> 00:09:41.500
That guy could neither stay a shepherd
who believed in God

00:09:42.500 --> 00:09:44.370
nor become a heartless sword.

00:09:45.290 --> 00:09:47.660
Enough chitchat. Hurry it up!

00:09:49.290 --> 00:09:50.540
Well, too bad.

00:09:53.580 --> 00:09:55.870
In the end, I'm the same.

00:09:57.700 --> 00:10:02.250
<i>No matter how much I call them monsters</i>
<i>as an excuse to take people's heads,</i>

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:05.870
<i>what lies before my eyes are human bodies.</i>

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:09.750
<i>What I've been killing were...</i>

00:10:10.830 --> 00:10:12.500
<i>without a doubt, humans.</i>

00:10:15.160 --> 00:10:17.000
I'm a man-slaying Exterminator.

00:10:18.370 --> 00:10:19.200
Going forward,

00:10:19.580 --> 00:10:23.450
I won't ever let anyone that I slay
be called a monster!

00:10:24.200 --> 00:10:26.870
They're all the same as me, just a human!

00:10:26.950 --> 00:10:28.160
So what?!

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:30.500
Look!

00:10:31.000 --> 00:10:33.450
These are the limbs
that split your flesh apart!

00:10:33.950 --> 00:10:35.160
I can't stay human.

00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:37.870
I'm a hideous monster
that can't even become a bug!

00:10:38.450 --> 00:10:42.370
If that dull blade of yours can only slay
humans, then I got no business with you!

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:45.370
I'll eat you and then find the next!

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:48.290
Prove that I'm a monster!

00:10:48.700 --> 00:10:51.000
All you need to do
is finish me off with disgust!

00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:54.000
Why can't I even have that much granted?!

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:55.000
Shut up!

00:10:55.370 --> 00:10:58.410
What kind of monster starts complaining
after getting beat up?!

00:10:59.330 --> 00:11:01.620
Quit your whining! Get up! Come on!

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:06.750
My wish won't come true anymore...

00:11:13.200 --> 00:11:16.250
<i>I couldn't take her place for anything.</i>

00:11:17.330 --> 00:11:19.120
When that's what I was born for...

00:11:41.870 --> 00:11:44.500
<i>Little Bo Peep</i>

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:47.870
<i>Has lost her sheep</i>

00:11:49.450 --> 00:11:50.660
Ilie's up here.

00:11:53.200 --> 00:11:54.250
A long time ago,

00:11:54.330 --> 00:11:57.450
there was an idiot who tried
to take me and Ilie away from here.

00:12:00.160 --> 00:12:02.790
There was something
I forgot to tell that idiot.

00:12:06.250 --> 00:12:07.750
Take care of my little sister.

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:12.450
I'll find my own path in life myself.

00:12:14.950 --> 00:12:15.790
Okay.

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:06.040
Acht...

00:13:07.370 --> 00:13:09.200
You gonna die, Franz?

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:14.660
I couldn't become a Cagaster...

00:13:15.540 --> 00:13:19.870
I was able to become a bug that dies
by the light in which it believed...

00:13:21.620 --> 00:13:22.450
You should...

00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:25.660
also fly towards what you believe in.

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:28.910
You're self-centered till the very end.

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:35.750
I gave Ilie away to that Exterminator.

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:36.910
I see...

00:13:38.700 --> 00:13:40.540
Hey, Acht...

00:13:43.540 --> 00:13:44.620
I loved you...

00:13:45.580 --> 00:13:47.750
in my own way, though.

00:13:50.160 --> 00:13:51.000
Yeah.

00:13:56.950 --> 00:13:58.910
Goodbye, Franz.

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:10.870
I'm sorry.

00:14:11.450 --> 00:14:12.790
You must've suffered.

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:20.160
Why am I the queen of bugs?

00:14:21.910 --> 00:14:24.080
If this body became a bug,

00:14:24.830 --> 00:14:27.120
would my worries and loneliness go away?

00:14:29.500 --> 00:14:31.290
If this is human evolution...

00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:36.080
You think I can stay here?

00:14:36.790 --> 00:14:38.040
Why not?

00:14:39.080 --> 00:14:41.330
I wouldn't exactly mind living here.

00:14:42.450 --> 00:14:45.370
That's impossible,
since you won't become a bug.

00:14:46.410 --> 00:14:47.750
My eyes can see

00:14:48.080 --> 00:14:51.040
who'll become a bug even tomorrow.

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:55.290
I can't stand to live knowing

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:58.120
the fate of everyone I meet from here on.

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:02.080
"I'm ready to take anyone's head any day.

00:15:03.620 --> 00:15:06.950
But I'm not ready to live with
someone on top of that."

00:15:07.660 --> 00:15:09.790
That's what I said before, right?

00:15:09.870 --> 00:15:11.540
But that's not really true.

00:15:13.830 --> 00:15:16.700
You can only take their heads
within 20 minutes of the outbreak.

00:15:17.040 --> 00:15:18.910
And they typically won't be a stranger.

00:15:19.950 --> 00:15:21.410
I was afraid of that.

00:15:21.540 --> 00:15:24.080
I wanted to keep my distance
as much as possible.

00:15:24.620 --> 00:15:27.620
But then I'd regret keeping
that distance later on.

00:15:28.450 --> 00:15:31.500
Why didn't I get to know them better
while they were still alive?

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:36.040
If I'm just gonna be making lame excuses,

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:40.500
I want to live together with everyone
even if I am afraid.

00:15:41.950 --> 00:15:44.000
The next head you have to take...

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:46.750
could be someone I turn into a bug.

00:15:47.950 --> 00:15:50.450
Then try it. I'm an Exterminator.

00:15:51.290 --> 00:15:53.580
If that happens, I'll hold your head...

00:15:54.250 --> 00:15:56.000
and survive till the very end.

00:16:07.450 --> 00:16:09.120
I'll be taking your daughter.

00:16:12.830 --> 00:16:14.160
I heard you well.

00:16:16.580 --> 00:16:17.950
I'll never forget it.

00:16:35.450 --> 00:16:36.290
Lizzy?

00:16:37.370 --> 00:16:38.290
I can tell.

00:16:39.870 --> 00:16:42.040
Our wish came true.

00:16:42.910 --> 00:16:43.750
I see.

00:16:44.450 --> 00:16:45.330
Then we did it!

00:16:45.870 --> 00:16:46.750
Yeah!

00:16:50.120 --> 00:16:51.000
Thanks.

00:16:51.080 --> 00:16:53.580
I promised Hadi to treat him.

00:16:54.040 --> 00:16:55.750
We'll surely get paid, right?

00:16:57.830 --> 00:17:00.910
What?!
Please tell me that we will, Commander!

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:04.870
What a relief, huh, Grandpa?

00:17:06.330 --> 00:17:09.540
When your parents burned and died here,

00:17:10.160 --> 00:17:13.620
I swore to never be under
the military's care, but...

00:17:14.250 --> 00:17:17.120
But there was always
that one guy who helped us.

00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:20.620
That's why, even though I know he's gone,

00:17:21.290 --> 00:17:23.830
<i>I keep thinking he'll do something for us.</i>

00:17:25.040 --> 00:17:26.000
We'll be fine.

00:17:26.830 --> 00:17:29.040
Me, everyone, we'll all do our best.

00:17:35.290 --> 00:17:36.540
I ended up surviving.

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:39.580
Looks like it'll be a while...

00:17:39.830 --> 00:17:41.330
until I get over there...

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:42.910
Qasim.

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:48.200
All good things come to an end.

00:17:49.790 --> 00:17:51.830
I had no place to return,

00:17:52.160 --> 00:17:54.250
that's why I wanted my own house.

00:17:55.160 --> 00:17:57.750
I never had anyone waiting for me...

00:17:59.000 --> 00:18:01.040
that's why I decided
to be the one waiting.

00:18:02.250 --> 00:18:04.040
Is this heaven's punishment?

00:18:04.330 --> 00:18:07.450
Because a failed mercenary
wanted such a thing?

00:18:08.040 --> 00:18:09.580
Mario!

00:18:10.540 --> 00:18:13.580
Al! Bahar! You two made it!

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:16.080
I'm surprised weak little
Enes was alive, too.

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:17.000
Shut up!

00:18:17.540 --> 00:18:20.500
Mario, please give us something to eat!

00:18:20.580 --> 00:18:22.500
We haven't eaten anything for a whole day!

00:18:23.290 --> 00:18:24.660
You guys are hungry?

00:18:24.750 --> 00:18:26.830
Look, they can come back.

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:28.830
As long as you're alive.

00:18:29.620 --> 00:18:30.580
You're right.

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:33.950
I can still stay here and wait.

00:18:37.660 --> 00:18:40.040
Now, let's prepare a cookout!

00:18:40.120 --> 00:18:41.410
Yeah!

00:18:45.830 --> 00:18:47.870
All right!

00:18:51.830 --> 00:18:53.950
Everyone, well done.

00:18:56.200 --> 00:18:58.700
We must thank the colonel
of the Allied Forces.

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:03.200
All units under Salif's command
have surrendered.

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:05.870
-Well done.
-Yes, sir.

00:19:17.910 --> 00:19:21.120
This is the second time
I'm saving your son.

00:19:22.700 --> 00:19:25.910
You better thank me, Lazarus.

00:19:56.580 --> 00:19:57.410
Acht!

00:20:40.790 --> 00:20:42.250
Now, where to?

00:20:42.910 --> 00:20:44.200
We can go wherever we want.

00:20:45.160 --> 00:20:48.620
Since I <i>am</i> a man that was able to grab
his bride from an insect cage

00:20:48.700 --> 00:20:49.910
and return alive.

00:20:50.040 --> 00:20:51.410
A bride?

00:20:51.500 --> 00:20:53.330
Since when did it turn into that?

00:20:53.410 --> 00:20:55.120
What do you mean, since when?

00:20:59.000 --> 00:21:00.870
Wherever you want to go, Kidow.

00:21:02.160 --> 00:21:05.250
Since I'm a seed that they left behind...

00:21:06.040 --> 00:21:08.200
Far, far away.

00:21:11.250 --> 00:21:12.910
That's where I want to go.

00:21:15.080 --> 00:21:16.790
Anywhere as long as it's far.

00:21:25.870 --> 00:21:27.660
Can I speak now?

00:21:29.000 --> 00:21:29.830
Mr. Jin!

00:21:29.910 --> 00:21:32.160
I thought you ran off, you lousy merchant.

00:21:32.830 --> 00:21:35.330
Shut up! I came all the way here
to pick you guys up!

00:21:35.700 --> 00:21:37.000
Hup... whoa!

00:21:41.500 --> 00:21:44.160
Wait. Kidow, let me go!

00:21:44.660 --> 00:21:47.080
-Kidow!
-Flirting in front of others now?

00:21:48.040 --> 00:21:50.200
Kidow, I said let me go!

00:21:50.290 --> 00:21:53.580
<i>There may come a day in the future</i>
<i>where you'll regret this choice...</i>

00:21:54.000 --> 00:21:55.870
<i>and hate me for it.</i>

00:21:56.870 --> 00:21:57.700
<i>That's why,</i>

00:21:58.290 --> 00:22:00.040
<i>at the very end of my life,</i>

00:22:01.160 --> 00:22:04.580
<i>but preferably in the distant future,</i>

00:22:05.370 --> 00:22:07.080
<i>I want to hear your response.</i>

00:22:41.750 --> 00:22:42.580
Go on.
